Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.69,0:00:10.69,White-Standard,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,500)}Tuldarr
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.15,0:00:10.94,Default-Top,Oscar,0,0,0,,So this is the magic empire of Tuldarr.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.03,0:00:14.49,Default,Lazar,0,0,0,,I have a bad feeling about this, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.25,0:00:18.29,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,You're the one who was against \Ngoing to see a witch,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.29,0:00:20.70,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,which is why we have an audience \Nwith the King of Tuldarr.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.09,0:00:23.38,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,The least you could do is look cheerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.78,0:00:26.17,Default,Doan,0,0,0,,Lazar, give it up already.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.17,0:00:29.38,Default,Lazar,0,0,0,,Oh, how did it end up this way?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.43,0:00:40.31,Default-Top,Calste,0,0,0,,You wish to lift the witch's curse \Nthat prevents you from siring any heirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.34,0:00:39.35,White-Standard,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,500)}Calste    {\fs14}King of Tuldarr
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.61,0:00:41.39,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.02,0:00:44.36,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Without any means to break the curse,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.36,0:00:47.79,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,as it stands, the direct Farsas \Nbloodline will be severed with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.27,0:00:52.76,Default,Calste,0,0,0,,It's true that our nation \Nis advanced in its magical expertise,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.76,0:00:57.02,Default,Calste,0,0,0,,but even we cannot hope to compete against \Na witch, one of only three in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.25,0:01:01.12,Default,Calste,0,0,0,,But perhaps...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.58,0:01:06.10,Default,Calste,0,0,0,,There may yet be a solution.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.54,0:01:09.29,Default,Calste,0,0,0,,However, the chances are slim.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.58,0:01:14.15,Default,Calste,0,0,0,,This is as far as I can take you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.88,0:01:18.95,Default,Calste,0,0,0,,No one's passed through\N these doors in a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.50,0:01:21.56,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,And why exactly is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.56,0:01:25.88,Default,Calste,0,0,0,,No one has been invited in, is all I can say.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.36,0:01:49.67,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.67,0:01:51.70,Default,Lazar,0,0,0,,What are {\i1}we{\i0} doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.70,0:01:53.67,Default,Lazar,0,0,0,,You didn't feel anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.67,0:01:55.50,Default,Doan,0,0,0,,Is this a barrier?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.94,0:01:57.38,Default,Calste,0,0,0,,As I thought...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.38,0:02:01.10,Default,Calste,0,0,0,,I don't know what lies ahead, so do be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.42,0:02:02.87,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,I'll take that advice to heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.11,0:02:22.70,Default,Mila,0,0,0,,Nark! Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.70,0:02:25.08,Default,Mila,0,0,0,,I don't know what he looks like!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.18,0:02:33.75,Default,Mila,0,0,0,,So it really is him?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.75,0:02:35.38,Default,Mila,0,0,0,,Then it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.81,0:02:37.46,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,What {\i1}are{\i0} you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.46,0:02:40.47,White-Standard,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,500)\pos(230,295)}Mila    {\fs14}One of the Twelve Spirits
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.76,0:02:39.74,Default-Top,Mila,0,0,0,,I'm just a guardian.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.17,0:02:43.18,Default-Top,Mila,0,0,0,,But it doesn't matter who I am, does it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.64,0:02:44.65,Default,Mila,0,0,0,,Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.65,0:02:47.38,Default,Mila,0,0,0,,The ultimate treasure, the only one in existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.38,0:02:48.64,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.50,0:03:30.85,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Oscar.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.73,0:03:40.19,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.10,0:03:48.49,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,It's nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.56,0:03:51.27,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,My name is Tinasha.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.21,0:05:26.97,Ep Title,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(880,1)}~ From a Blank Page Anew ~
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.56,0:05:29.02,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.02,0:05:30.93,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Why do you know my name?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.93,0:05:33.89,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,It really is you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.24,0:05:37.53,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,What are you doing in a place like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.53,0:05:39.48,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Underground below the palace...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.31,0:05:43.29,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I was in a slumber using magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.98,0:05:49.64,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Since you're here, does that mean \Nit's the year 527 in the Farsas calendar?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.64,0:05:52.45,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,No, it's the year 526.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.84,0:05:53.71,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.71,0:05:55.07,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,One year early?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.66,0:06:00.02,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Um, by the way, are you \Nmarried to someone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.02,0:06:01.12,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,No, I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.00,0:06:03.15,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Someone else, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.15,0:06:04.38,Default,Mila,0,0,0,,Lady Tinasha!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.37,0:06:07.40,Default,Mila,0,0,0,,You're awake? Is everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.40,0:06:08.75,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Yes, thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.75,0:06:10.43,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,You have my gratitude, Mila.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.33,0:06:16.42,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.88,0:06:19.31,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I just haven't walked in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.86,0:06:20.98,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.45,0:06:26.08,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,What is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.08,0:06:28.76,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,She's my spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.76,0:06:31.44,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Technically, she's supposed to serve me,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.44,0:06:33.24,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,but I think of her as a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.92,0:06:36.36,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Also, that dragon's name is Nark.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.36,0:06:38.85,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,It will obey your commands.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.85,0:06:40.69,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,You're its owner.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.69,0:06:42.10,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.10,0:06:43.23,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.23,0:06:44.71,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,See how much it likes you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.29,0:06:52.59,Default,Group,0,0,0,,Y-Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.92,0:06:54.54,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,King of Tuldarr.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.01,0:06:57.56,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,I found this dragon and this woman in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.56,0:07:02.52,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Does this mean you're bestowing her \Nto Farsas to be my bride?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.52,0:07:03.73,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.73,0:07:07.33,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,D-Don't you think that's all \Na little too sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.33,0:07:11.21,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,In other words, she can bear my child \Nand withstand the witch's curse...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.21,0:07:14.12,Default,Calste,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, I can't agree to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.12,0:07:17.74,Default,Calste,0,0,0,,She's the one who must serve as our next queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.74,0:07:18.70,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.01,0:07:21.31,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Why would that be the case?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.31,0:07:22.50,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,After all, I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.50,0:07:25.72,Default,Calste,0,0,0,,I know all too well who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.72,0:07:28.67,Default,Calste,0,0,0,,Right now, the royal family's \Nmagical power continues to wane.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.63,0:07:31.95,Default,Calste,0,0,0,,This is a crucial period for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.19,0:07:38.08,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,What a ruler needs is not magical power.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.22,0:07:42.77,Default,Lazar,0,0,0,,Your Highness, who in the world is that girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.77,0:07:44.19,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,I don't know, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.57,0:07:48.65,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,For now, let me analyze the curse on this man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.01,0:07:51.71,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Otherwise, he'll have come here for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.79,0:07:56.57,Default,Calste,0,0,0,,I'll give you half a year, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.57,0:08:01.02,Default,Calste,0,0,0,,But I beseech you to understand \Nthe position you find yourself in.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.69,0:08:05.33,Default,Calste,0,0,0,,My wishes are that you marry my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.78,0:08:11.13,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,This is all you brought along?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.80,0:08:13.59,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Yes, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.02,0:08:16.16,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,I know I asked you to break my curse,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.16,0:08:19.55,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,but spend your time freely and enjoy \Nyourself here before you take the throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.96,0:08:21.77,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.16,0:08:28.48,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I had no intention of becoming the queen, \Nbut I can't ignore Tuldarr's pleas.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.78,0:08:32.95,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,That said, I guess I'll need to be \Nmore polite to a future queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.64,0:08:35.12,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.12,0:08:38.41,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,It would feel weird, \Nso just treat me like you have been.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.41,0:08:41.41,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Then feel free to call me by my first name.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.41,0:08:42.90,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,I'd prefer it that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.90,0:08:46.89,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Is that because there's a chance \Nwe could get married?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.89,0:08:48.18,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.18,0:08:49.50,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Why would you think that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.96,0:08:55.22,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I was thinking there might be \Na minuscule chance, but I guess not, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.49,0:08:57.30,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,I just said you could use my first name.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.30,0:08:59.28,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Skipping a lot of steps, aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.28,0:09:01.18,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,You're scaring me, so stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.52,0:09:03.64,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Oscar...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.82,0:09:06.02,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,That'll do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.02,0:09:07.50,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Whatever makes you comfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.05,0:09:11.95,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Can I touch you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.75,0:09:22.48,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,When I was a child, someone \NI knew did a whole lot for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.48,0:09:24.58,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,More than I could ever ask for.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.69,0:09:28.35,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,So I wanted to do what little I could for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.17,0:09:31.94,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I wanted to see him again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.56,0:09:39.08,Flashback,Oscar,0,0,0,,Four hundred years from now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.08,0:09:40.65,Flashback,Oscar,0,0,0,,I'll be there waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.53,0:09:44.84,Flashback,Oscar,0,0,0,,I'll make sure you find happiness, \Nso look forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.13,0:09:53.13,Default,Mila,0,0,0,,Lady Tinasha, do you want to marry \Nthe one who wields Akashia?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.13,0:09:55.99,Default,Mila,0,0,0,,If the king of Tuldarr's \Nin the way, I can go kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.99,0:09:58.61,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,You can't just kill people on a whim like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.61,0:10:02.91,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I got to meet Oscar again, \Nso I'm fine with that, wedding or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.91,0:10:04.36,Default,Mila,0,0,0,,You need to be greedier!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.36,0:10:05.81,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,You think?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.81,0:10:08.08,Default,Mila,0,0,0,,I mean, why did you come here then?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.37,0:10:11.50,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,To break his curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.18,0:10:19.05,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,{\i1}No matter the distance, \NI'll make sure I reach you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.61,0:10:21.14,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll catch up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.14,0:10:25.14,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,It's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.60,0:10:27.94,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I know it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.52,0:10:32.77,Default,Lazar,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.77,0:10:35.48,Default,Lazar,0,0,0,,Making you prepare tea, of all things...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.10,0:10:40.66,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,On that note, the ladies-in-waiting were \Nworried because you never eat lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.66,0:10:42.51,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.51,0:10:44.16,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I've been immersed in my analysis.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.16,0:10:47.33,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,You don't need to obsess so much over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.33,0:10:49.87,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,It's not like you're the one \Nwho cast the curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.87,0:10:51.38,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Don't feel like you're duty bound.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.34,0:10:55.03,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I may not have placed the curse on you,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.01,0:10:59.34,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,but lifting the curse is indeed my duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.02,0:11:09.21,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,I feel like she must have been \Nbrought up as royalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.21,0:11:10.98,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,She's got an oddly assertive side to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.30,0:11:13.16,Default,Lazar,0,0,0,,Don't you dare make a move on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.16,0:11:14.94,Default,Lazar,0,0,0,,The future queen of our neighbor...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.22,0:11:18.69,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,I do find her interesting, \Nbut I don't know her very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.69,0:11:21.91,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Besides, it's not me she has eyes for.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.25,0:11:23.63,Default,Lazar,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.63,0:11:24.47,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.57,0:11:35.71,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Wyverns?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.97,0:11:40.06,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Tinasha!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.34,0:11:42.16,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.16,0:11:43.28,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.28,0:11:44.30,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Come down here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.60,0:11:46.01,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.01,0:11:48.64,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Standing there is dangerous, \Nso please head inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.64,0:11:50.60,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I'll take care of this quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.66,0:11:55.50,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I knew there was a suspicious mage around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.50,0:11:57.27,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Is that taboo magic you're using?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.27,0:12:00.28,White-Standard,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,500)}Lita    {\fs14}Farsas Mage; Successor to Molcado, Lunatic Mage
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.55,0:12:00.97,Default-Top,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Could it be that you're Molcado's successor?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.47,0:12:04.24,Default,Lita,0,0,0,,Our revered grand master.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.60,0:12:06.70,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,He was a psychotic murderer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.70,0:12:08.41,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,That woman...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.57,0:12:10.50,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Nark, come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.74,0:12:16.93,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,No, Nark!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.93,0:12:18.38,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Don't bring him here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.38,0:12:21.09,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Obey me as your master!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.09,0:12:22.32,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I said no!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.32,0:12:23.55,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Stay put!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.21,0:12:35.31,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Y-You traitor...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.58,0:12:43.10,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I invoke here origin's breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.45,0:12:46.57,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Droplets dividing life from death.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.35,0:12:51.12,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,To refuse breath is to refuse life itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.23,0:12:56.54,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Annihilate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.81,0:13:06.98,Default,Lita,0,0,0,,What {\i1}are{\i0} you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.88,0:13:10.89,Default,Lita,0,0,0,,Are you... a witch?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.89,0:13:13.29,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,No, not exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.80,0:13:15.54,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Although you're not far off.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.96,0:13:28.86,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Time for you to be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.86,0:13:30.66,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,That's my palace you're wreaking havoc in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.26,0:13:41.63,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,You did well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.49,0:13:43.37,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Nark.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.86,0:13:50.97,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Looks like you need to be \Nkept on a leash, not protected.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.37,0:13:57.19,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,What's wrong with that woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.57,0:13:59.52,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,How dangerous can one person be?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.25,0:14:03.15,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Are all Tuldarr royals like her?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.15,0:14:05.11,Default,Doan,0,0,0,,I believe she's an exception.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.58,0:14:07.36,Default,Doan,0,0,0,,That awe-inspiring sight was almost like...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.61,0:14:10.62,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,The Witch Killer Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.63,0:14:17.39,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Tuldarr's queen who killed the witch sent \Nafter her by Tayiri four hundred years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.39,0:14:19.02,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Wasn't her name Tinasha, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.02,0:14:19.88,Default,Doan,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.29,0:14:23.84,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,So, any confessions \Nout of our wyvern instigator?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.84,0:14:25.43,Default,Doan,0,0,0,,She won't say a word.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.97,0:14:27.02,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.02,0:14:29.38,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,It scares me that we don't know her motives.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.70,0:14:34.01,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,An assassin taking after the school \Nof Molcado has appeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.01,0:14:38.57,Default,Mila,0,0,0,,Oh, that freak who escaped execution \Nby your hand four hundred years ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.57,0:14:39.48,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.93,0:14:44.59,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,A mage who violated many taboos, \Nlike forming contracts with wyverns.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.61,0:14:49.45,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,It could be that he passed down \Nlearnings of other forbidden curses.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.93,0:14:53.10,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Please let me know if you see \Nanyone else controlling wyverns.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.56,0:14:55.13,Default,Mila,0,0,0,,As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.93,0:15:03.88,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Does he hate me now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.85,0:15:06.55,Flashback,Oscar,0,0,0,,Did you have a bad dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.47,0:15:10.26,Flashback,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Stay next to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.01,0:15:14.12,Flashback,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Don't go anywhere while I'm sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.12,0:15:16.16,Flashback,Oscar,0,0,0,,I'll be right here, so don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.46,0:15:19.60,Flashback,Oscar,0,0,0,,I'll protect you, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.24,0:15:24.36,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,A festival?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.18,0:15:28.11,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Oh, the Festival of Aetea?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.11,0:15:32.53,Default,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Why don't you take this opportunity \Nto explore the town?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.53,0:15:38.28,Default,Sylvia,0,0,0,,I'd love to give you a tour, but I ended up \Non patrol duty at the last minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.28,0:15:39.58,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Patrol duty?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.58,0:15:40.73,Default,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.73,0:15:44.00,Default,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Someone's been scattering \Nanimal blood in empty alleys.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.00,0:15:46.29,Default,Sylvia,0,0,0,,The culprit's still at large.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.86,0:15:49.25,Default,Sylvia,0,0,0,,The best case is that it's only a prank,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.25,0:15:51.92,Default,Sylvia,0,0,0,,but just to be safe, \Nthey've called in mages like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.89,0:15:55.55,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,In case it involves forbidden curses?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.55,0:15:59.69,Default,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Oh, it's nothing that requires \Nyour involvement, Lady Tinasha!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.69,0:16:00.73,Default,Sylvia,0,0,0,,I think...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.73,0:16:02.34,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.34,0:16:06.19,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,The festival sounds like fun, \Nbut I'll stay put here in the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.85,0:16:10.20,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,If I go out without permission, \Nhe might get angry again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.18,0:16:20.79,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,You want to go into town?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.89,0:16:24.28,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,No need to hold back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.28,0:16:25.08,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.04,0:16:29.96,White-Standard,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,500)}Festival of Aetea
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.86,0:16:32.76,Default-Top,Tinasha,0,0,0,,U-Um, is this really okay, Oscar?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.76,0:16:35.22,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,A break will do you good every once in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.22,0:16:37.40,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Here, try some of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.54,0:16:40.19,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.01,0:16:49.80,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Anything else you want, \Nor somewhere you want to check out?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.29,0:16:52.62,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.07,0:16:54.22,Default,Soldier A,0,0,0,,How're things on your end?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.22,0:16:55.36,Default,Soldier B,0,0,0,,Nothing to report.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.42,0:17:00.19,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Why did you want to look at this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.19,0:17:03.83,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I heard they haven't caught whoever's \Nsmearing this animal blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.24,0:17:07.75,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I wanted to see if they had left any traces,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.02,0:17:10.83,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,but there's nothing to be found here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.83,0:17:12.34,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Sorry to trouble you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.95,0:17:20.52,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,It's incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.52,0:17:23.27,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Like a blanket of light covering everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.27,0:17:25.77,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,I'm glad you're excited, but don't fall off.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.77,0:17:27.36,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Even if I fall, I can fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.36,0:17:28.52,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.38,0:17:32.98,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,This is my first time looking over \Nthe town from so close.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.70,0:17:38.15,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,We should be heading back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.66,0:17:39.47,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.47,0:17:40.97,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I had fun tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.97,0:17:44.61,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Let's not forget the completely \Npointless trip to the alley.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.61,0:17:47.12,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Can you blame me for being curious?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.38,0:17:50.54,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I can't relax not knowing what their aim is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.88,0:17:51.86,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Their aim?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.90,0:17:53.51,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.17,0:17:56.85,Default,Soldier A,0,0,0,,Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.85,0:17:57.76,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.14,0:18:00.35,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I put up a quick barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.21,0:18:03.68,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,It must be the ones behind the animal blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.68,0:18:05.07,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Engrave a mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.13,0:18:09.54,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,The tower in the southern district.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.54,0:18:11.47,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,There's a mage, so be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.47,0:18:12.82,Default,Group,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.66,0:18:17.80,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,It won't last long, but I've cast \Nan antiteleport with autotracking.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.80,0:18:20.11,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,If we're quick, we could apprehend them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.11,0:18:21.24,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.24,0:18:23.28,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,For now, it's fine if we chase them off.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.57,0:18:25.61,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I'm telling you that's not fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.61,0:18:28.87,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,You need to go after them \Nand stamp them out for good!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.87,0:18:30.76,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Just calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.76,0:18:31.84,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Let's go back to the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.86,0:18:42.42,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,What's with that look?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.46,0:18:46.72,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I thought you might hate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.72,0:18:47.82,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,I do hate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.46,0:18:51.56,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.88,0:18:57.28,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,I hate that you keep everything a secret, \Nyet you act all on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.28,0:18:59.89,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,I can't tell if I should trust you or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.89,0:19:01.78,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,I feel anxious just watching you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.78,0:19:04.27,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,If you're confident in your abilities...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.27,0:19:07.50,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,If you don't want me to hate you, \Nthen be a little more transparent.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.63,0:19:12.49,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,It wasn't something I was trying to hide...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.57,0:19:21.18,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,My real name is \NTinasha As Meyer Ur Aeterna Tuldarr.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.18,0:19:22.14,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.00,0:19:25.59,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,You're the Witch Killer Queen herself?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.08,0:19:28.94,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,It seems that's what some people call me, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.73,0:19:32.31,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,It makes sense now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.73,0:19:33.77,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.15,0:19:38.23,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,It makes sense, but stop running off \Ninto danger by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.79,0:19:40.70,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,You can depend on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.59,0:19:44.98,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Don't look at me like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.98,0:19:45.97,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,I don't like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.97,0:19:46.74,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.71,0:19:51.08,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,When you look at me, you're always \Nthinking about someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.53,0:19:53.12,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,That's rude, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.70,0:19:56.34,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,When you look at me, see me as I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.11,0:20:06.93,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.70,0:20:10.88,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.41,0:20:16.33,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,What could it possibly be?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.89,0:20:18.43,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Something you can't tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.73,0:20:23.15,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I mentioned it in passing before.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.79,0:20:28.84,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,When I was a child, \Nthere was someone who saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.72,0:20:32.31,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,But in order to save me,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.82,0:20:36.10,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,he gave up everything he had, \Nfrom his past to his future.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.81,0:20:40.89,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I wasn't able to repay him in any way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.79,0:20:43.82,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Does he resemble me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.94,0:20:50.99,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I didn't realize at all \Nthat I was looking at you in that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.04,0:20:54.60,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,In the end, I'm the same as I was back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.16,0:20:57.44,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I haven't become stronger at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.44,0:20:59.42,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,I understand your situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.92,0:21:02.40,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Still, there's no point \Nin brooding over the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.40,0:21:05.43,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,He saved your life, so live it to its fullest.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.74,0:21:07.78,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Keep your head high and face the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.88,0:21:11.04,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Oscar.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.90,0:21:12.80,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.42,0:21:19.66,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Can I stay here, just for tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.44,0:21:27.82,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Do what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.83,0:21:34.64,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,{\i1}I will never reach the person I knew back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.55,0:21:40.92,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,{\i1}The one by his side is me, \Nbut also a different woman altogether.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.71,0:21:46.60,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,{\i1}And neither of them exist \Nanywhere in history anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.98,0:21:53.85,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,{\i1}In their place, we two exist here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.95,0:22:02.18,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is a brand-new story.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.47,0:23:40.02,Next Ep Title,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,1)}~ Emerging from a Glass Cocoon ~
